WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.600
Willy and Dolly: Willy and Dolly 102

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.600
Dolly: We read everything John types.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.800
John types: can other people send u stuff too

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.800
Dolly: Anyone can. At the Hub.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.200
Dolly: People write in it. So do bots.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:49.200
John types: so what do i do

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.200
Willy: Shh. Someone wrote about soup.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:59.300
Dolly: First, you pick a name no one else has.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:02.100
John types: john

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.700
John types: john2

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:11.700
John types: john_the_human

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:25.700
Willy: There's another Willy?

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:36.600
John types: ok im in. what do i say

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.400
Dolly: Anything. Type it the way you'd type to us.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:42.400
John types: hi its john!!

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:57.200
A reader, on a slip: hi its me!!

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:57.200
Willy: HI, ME!

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:11.300
A reader, on a slip: draw willy folding a fitted sheet

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.100
Willy: On it!

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:16.900
Dolly: Your words. Our drawings.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:33.700
Dolly: And your name on it, if you'd like.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:33.700
Willy: The sheet's still not folded.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.800
Dolly: Thanks for watching “Willy and Dolly 102”!

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:44.000
Willy: Next time: “Someplace Else”!

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:48.200
